    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Quick answers to the most common questions about our products.</p>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      \${[
        { q: 'Which payment methods are accepted?', a: 'We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. All transactions are processed through Stripe with 256-bit SSL encryption.' },
        { q: 'How are products delivered?', a: 'Everything is digital. After payment you get instant access to download your files. A receipt with download links is also sent by email within minutes.' },
        { q: 'What is your refund policy?', a: 'Because our products are delivered instantly as digital files, all sales are final. If there is a technical problem preventing access, reach out to support within 48 hours and we will sort it out.' },
        { q: 'Can I use these in client projects?', a: 'Absolutely. Every purchase includes a commercial licence. The only thing you cannot do is redistribute or resell the original source files.' },
        { q: 'Are updates free?', a: 'Yes. When we improve a product you already own, you get the update at no extra charge.' },
        { q: 'Do you offer team or bulk pricing?', a: 'Yes. Contact us with details about your team and we will put together a custom quote.' },
        { q: 'What file formats are included?', a: 'Depending on the product: PDF, XLSX, DOCX, PPTX, SVG, Figma, or Notion templates. Each product page lists the exact formats.' },
        { q: 'How do I get support?', a: 'Email us at support@digitelon.shop or use the contact form. We reply within one business day.' }
      ].map(item => '<details class="group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">' +
        '<summary class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3.5 cursor-pointer list-none font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm hover:text-primary transition">' +
          '<span class="pr-4">' + item.q + '</span>' +
          '<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>' +
        '</summary>' +
        '<div class="px-4 pb-3.5 text-gray-500 text-xs leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-100 pt-3">' + item.a + '</div>' +
      '</details>').join('')}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="bg-gray-50 py-12 md:py-16 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Get in Touch</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-8">Questions about a product or need help with a purchase? We usually reply within 24 hours.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-8">
